---
// Static Astro port of the original homepage structure. Existing class names are preserved so home.css remains the source of truth.
---
<!-- HERO -->
<section data-screen-label="Hero" class="home_hero_section is-first-section">
  <div class="home_hero_div">
    
    <h1 class="home_hero_h1"><div><span class="home_hero_span">Code ships fast now.</span></div><div><span class="home_hero_span-2">Products still don't.</span></div></h1>
    <div class="home_hero_div-2"><p class="isSelectedEnd">AI made teams faster. Handoffs became the bottleneck.</p><p class="isSelectedEnd">Interfluent gives business, product, and engineering one shared understanding of the system and AI agents that can reason, coordinate, and act across it.</p><p>Instead of isolated productivity gains, Interfluent makes the whole organization compound.</p></div>
    <div class="home_hero_div-3">
      <a href="#cta" class="home_hero_a">Book a walkthrough</a>
      <a href="#today" class="home_hero_a-2">Read the story ↓</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero illustration: two lanes -->
  <div class="rs-heroviz home_hero_div-4">
    <div class="home_hero_div-5"></div>
    <div class="home_hero_div-6">
      <div class="home_hero_div-7">
        <span class="home_hero_span-3">CODE</span>
        <span class="home_hero_span-4">47 changes today</span>
      </div>
      <div class="home_hero_div-8">
        <div class="home_hero_div-9">
          <div class="home_hero_div-10">
            <span class="home_hero_span-5">feat: symbol classifier v2</span>
            <span class="home_hero_span-6">fix: pdf raster memory</span>
            <span class="home_hero_span-7">chore: bump pdfjs-dist</span>
            <span class="home_hero_span-8">feat: line-type review</span>
            <span class="home_hero_span-9">refactor: graph export</span>
            <span class="home_hero_span-10">fix: dwg unit scaling</span>
          </div>
          <div class="home_hero_div-11">
            <span class="home_hero_span-11">feat: symbol classifier v2</span>
            <span class="home_hero_span-12">fix: pdf raster memory</span>
            <span class="home_hero_span-13">chore: bump pdfjs-dist</span>
            <span class="home_hero_span-14">feat: line-type review</span>
            <span class="home_hero_span-15">refactor: graph export</span>
            <span class="home_hero_span-16">fix: dwg unit scaling</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- the gap between -->
      <div class="rs-gap home_hero_div-12">
        <div class="home_hero_div-13"></div>
        <div class="home_hero_div-14">Which feature does this touch?</div>
        <div class="rs-bub2 home_hero_div-15">What will it cost?</div>
        <div class="rs-bub3 home_hero_div-16">Is the documentation still true?</div>
        <div class="home_hero_div-17">?</div>
      </div>

      <div class="home_hero_div-18">
        <span class="home_hero_span-17">PRODUCT</span>
        <span class="home_hero_span-18">1 capability this quarter</span>
      </div>
      <div class="home_hero_div-19">
        <div class="home_hero_div-20"><span>Review Symbols v2</span><span class="home_hero_span-19">waiting on estimate</span></div>
        <div class="home_hero_div-21"><div class="home_hero_div-22"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ACT 1 · TODAY -->
<section id="today" data-screen-label="Act 1 · Today" class="home_act-1-today_section">
  <div class="home_act-1-today_div">
    <div class="home_act-1-today_div-2">01 · TODAY</div>
    <h2 class="home_act-1-today_h2">Three rooms. Three languages. One system nobody can see whole.</h2>
    <p class="home_act-1-today_p">Business talks in capabilities. Product talks in requirements. Engineering talks in repositories. Every planning conversation starts by redrawing the map by hand, and the map is stale by the time the meeting ends.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- three islands -->
  <div class="home_act-1-today_div-3">
    <div style="transform:translate(0px, 0px) rotate(-1.5deg);transition:transform .12s linear;background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);border-radius:20px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(30,28,25,.07)">
      <div class="home_act-1-today_div-4"><span class="home_act-1-today_span">BUSINESS</span><span class="home_act-1-today_span-2"></span></div>
      <div class="home_act-1-today_div-5">Talks in capabilities</div>
      <div class="home_act-1-today_div-6">
        <span class="home_act-1-today_span-3">Improve On-boarding Time</span>
        <span class="home_act-1-today_span-4">Improve Pilot Conversion Rate</span>
        
        
      </div>
      <div class="home_act-1-today_div-7">How big is change in Review Symbols?</div>
    </div>

    <div style="transform:translate(0px, 0px);transition:transform .12s linear;background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);border-radius:20px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(30,28,25,.07)">
      <div class="home_act-1-today_div-8"><span class="home_act-1-today_span-5">PRODUCT / BA</span><span class="home_act-1-today_span-6"></span></div>
      <div class="home_act-1-today_div-9">Talks in requirements</div>
      <div class="home_act-1-today_div-10">
        <div class="home_act-1-today_div-11">PRD · Review Symbols v2 <span class="home_act-1-today_span-7">DRAFT</span></div>
        <div class="home_act-1-today_div-12"></div>
        <div class="home_act-1-today_div-13"></div>
        <div class="home_act-1-today_div-14"></div>
        <div class="home_act-1-today_div-15"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="home_act-1-today_div-16">“Which services does this actually touch?”</div>
    </div>

    <div style="transform:translate(0px, 0px) rotate(1.5deg);transition:transform .12s linear;background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);border-radius:20px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(30,28,25,.07)">
      <div class="home_act-1-today_div-17"><span class="home_act-1-today_span-8">ENGINEERING</span><span class="home_act-1-today_span-9"></span></div>
      <div class="home_act-1-today_div-18">Talks in repositories</div>
      <div class="home_act-1-today_div-19">
        <div class="home_act-1-today_div-20">classifier/<span class="home_act-1-today_span-10">SymbolClassifierService.ts</span></div>
        <div class="home_act-1-today_div-21">conversion/<span class="home_act-1-today_span-11">DrawingConversionService.ts</span></div>
        <div class="home_act-1-today_div-22">lines/<span class="home_act-1-today_span-12">LineTypeService.ts</span></div>
        <div class="home_act-1-today_div-23">tests/classifier.spec.ts · 61%</div>
      </div>
      <div class="home_act-1-today_div-24">“Which capability is this debt under?”</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- four leaks -->
  <div class="home_act-1-today_div-25">
    
      <div style="opacity:;transform:translateY(px);transition:opacity .1s linear,transform .1s linear;padding:26px 24px;border-top:2px solid var(--color-primary)">
        <div class="home_act-1-today_div-26"></div>
        <div class="home_act-1-today_div-27"></div>
        <div class="home_act-1-today_div-28"></div>
      </div>
    
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ACT 2 · SHARED CONTEXT (pinned stage) -->
<section id="context" data-screen-label="Act 2 · Shared context" class="home_act-2-shared-context_section">
  <div class="rs-stage home_act-2-shared-context_div">
    <div class="rs-pin2 home_act-2-shared-context_div-2">
      <div class="rs-pin2-left home_act-2-shared-context_div-3">
        <div class="home_act-2-shared-context_div-4">02 · WHAT SHIPPING WELL NEEDS</div>
        <h2 class="home_act-2-shared-context_h2">One picture of the system that all three rooms can read.</h2>
        <div class="rs-pin2-copy home_act-2-shared-context_div-5">
          <p style="position:absolute;inset:0;margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(246,243,236,.85);opacity:1;transform:translateY(0px);text-wrap:pretty">Start with what the business actually cares about: product capabilities. Put them next to the services that implement them, instead of a slide that gets redrawn every quarter.</p>
          <p style="position:absolute;inset:0;margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(246,243,236,.85);opacity:0;transform:translateY(0px);text-wrap:pretty">Then add intent. Requirements, briefs and documentation become nodes in the same model as classes, methods and tests. A business question and a technical question now share an answer path.</p>
          <p style="position:absolute;inset:0;margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(246,243,236,.85);opacity:0;transform:translateY(0px);text-wrap:pretty">Once everything is connected, a change can be priced before a date is promised, and the record can be rewritten from the model when the system moves. The next change gets cheaper than the last.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="home_act-2-shared-context_div-6">
          <span class="home_act-2-shared-context_span"><span style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--color-accent);transform-origin:left;transform:scaleX(1)"></span></span>
          <span class="home_act-2-shared-context_span-2"><span style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--color-accent);transform-origin:left;transform:scaleX(0)"></span></span>
          <span class="home_act-2-shared-context_span-3"><span style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--color-accent);transform-origin:left;transform:scaleX(0)"></span></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- graph stage -->
      <div class="rs-pin2-graph home_act-2-shared-context_div-7">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="home_act-2-shared-context_svg">
          
            <line x1="" y1="" x2="" y2="" pathLength="1" stroke="" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-linecap="round" style="stroke-dasharray:1;stroke-dashoffset:;opacity:"></line>
          
        </svg>
        <div style="position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:50%;height:1px;background:rgba(246,243,236,.18);opacity:1"></div>
        <div style="position:absolute;left:0;top:calc(50% - 20px);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:rgba(246,243,236,.55);opacity:1">PRODUCT · INTENT</div>
        <div style="position:absolute;left:0;top:calc(50% + 8px);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:rgba(246,243,236,.55);opacity:1">CODE · ENTITIES</div>
        
          <div style="position:absolute;left:%;top:%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale();opacity:;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:;background:;color:;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.18);font-family:"></div>
        
        <div style="position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:0;transform:translateX(-50%);opacity:1;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(224,164,88,.6);color:var(--color-accent);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;white-space:nowrap">ONE CONNECTED MODEL · FEATURES · REQUIREMENTS · DOCS · CODE</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ACT 3 · CODELENS -->
<section id="codelens" data-screen-label="Act 3 · Interfluent" class="home_act-3-interfluent_section">
  <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div">
    <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-2">03 · CODELENS</div>
    <h2 class="home_act-3-interfluent_h2">Interfluent is that shared context. And the agents that work from it.</h2>
    <p class="home_act-3-interfluent_p">Product capabilities above the line, the services that implement them below it. Every node carries what the agents currently know about it: requirement status, documentation, debt and coverage. Select one and everything known about it opens in one place.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- app window -->
  <div style="margin-top:64px;position:relative;border-radius:22px;background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(30,28,25,.1);overflow:hidden;opacity:1;transform:translateY(0px) scale(1)">
    <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-3">
      <span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span"></span><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-2"></span><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-3"></span>
      <span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-4">Plant360 / Convert / Canvas</span>
      <span class="rs-appsearch home_act-3-interfluent_span-5">Search graph, docs, findings &nbsp;⌘K</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rs-app home_act-3-interfluent_div-4">
      <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-5">
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-6">Pulse</div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-7">Canvas</div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-8">Context Graph</div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-9">PRODUCT</div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-10">PRDs <span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-6">2</span></div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-11">User Documentation</div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-12">Engineering Briefs</div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-13">ENGINEERING</div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-14">Impact Analysis</div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-15">Technical Debt</div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-16">Security <span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-7">3</span></div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-17">Test Coverage</div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-18">Test Planning</div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-19">Agent Builder</div>
      </div>
      <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-20">
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-21">
          <div><div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-22">Product feature map</div><div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-23">10 features · 4 services · 23 linked documents</div></div>
          <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-24"><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-8">PRD status</span><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-9">Docs</span><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-10">Debt &amp; security</span><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-11">Coverage</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-25">PRODUCT FEATURES</div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-26">
          
            <div style="opacity:;transform:translateY(px);background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid ;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 11px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(30,28,25,.05)">
              <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-27"></div>
              <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-28"></div>
              <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;opacity:;transform:scale();transform-origin:left">
                <span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9.5px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:;color:"></span>
                <span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-12"></span>
                <span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9.5px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:;color:"></span>
                <span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9.5px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:;color:"></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          
        </div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-29"><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-13">CODE ENTITIES · SERVICES</span><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-14"></span></div>
        <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-30">
          
            <div style="opacity:;transform:translateY(px);background:var(--color-bg);border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.12);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 11px">
              <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-31"></div>
              <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-32"></div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:4px;opacity:"><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-15"></span><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-16"></span></div>
            </div>
          
        </div>

        <!-- drawer -->
        <div style="position:absolute;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:min(340px,80%);background:var(--color-surface);border-left:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);box-shadow:-20px 0 50px rgba(30,28,25,.08);transform:translateX(0%);padding:22px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;overflow:hidden">
          <div><div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-33">FEATURE</div><div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-34">Review Symbols</div></div>
          <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-35">
            <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-36"><div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-37">Code entities</div><div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-38">15</div></div>
            <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-39"><div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-40">High findings</div><div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-41">12</div></div>
            <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-42"><div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-43">Coverage</div><div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-44">71%</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-45">
            <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-46"><span>Review Symbols V2</span><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-17">DRAFT</span></div>
            <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-47"><span>Review Symbols V1</span><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-18">PUBLISHED</span></div>
            <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-48"><span>Symbology docs</span><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-19">OUT OF SYNC</span></div>
            <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-49"><span>Technical debt</span><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-20">41 findings</span></div>
            <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-50"><span>Security</span><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-21">1 critical · 2 high</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-51"><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-22">Create PRD</span><span class="home_act-3-interfluent_span-23">Analyse impact</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Act 3b · price the change -->
<section data-screen-label="Act 3 · Impact" class="home_act-3-impact_section">
  <div>
    <div class="home_act-3-impact_div">PRICE THE CHANGE FIRST</div>
    <h3 class="home_act-3-impact_h3">Describe the change in a sentence. Get the blast radius back before anyone promises a date.</h3>
    <p class="home_act-3-impact_p">Files touched, tests affected and documents that will drift come back as a size band with the relationships behind it. Scope becomes evidence rather than a score to argue with.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);border-radius:20px;padding:24px;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(30,28,25,.08);opacity:1;transform:translateY(0px)">
    <div class="home_act-3-impact_div-2">IMPACT ANALYSIS</div>
    <div class="home_act-3-impact_div-3">Retire the legacy DXF parser and route all imports through DrawingConversionService.<span class="home_act-3-impact_span"></span></div>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin:18px 0 14px;opacity:1;transform:translateY(0px)">
      <div class="home_act-3-impact_div-4">M</div>
      <div><div class="home_act-3-impact_div-5">Medium change</div><div class="home_act-3-impact_div-6">14 files · 6 tests · 3 documents to update</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="home_act-3-impact_div-7">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--color-bg);opacity:1;transform:translateX(0px)"><span class="home_act-3-impact_span-2">DrawingConversionService</span><span class="home_act-3-impact_span-3">implements · Convert drawings</span></div>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--color-bg);opacity:1;transform:translateX(0px)"><span class="home_act-3-impact_span-4">dxf-parser.spec.ts</span><span class="home_act-3-impact_span-5">untested path</span></div>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--color-bg);opacity:1;transform:translateX(0px)"><span class="home_act-3-impact_span-6">User docs · Importing DXF</span><span class="home_act-3-impact_span-7">will drift</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Agents -->
<section data-screen-label="Act 3 · Agents" class="home_act-3-agents_section">
  <div class="home_act-3-agents_div">
    <div class="home_act-3-agents_div-2">
      <div class="home_act-3-agents_div-3">THE AGENT SUITE</div>
      <h3 class="home_act-3-agents_h3">Agents that read from the model and write back into it.</h3>
    </div>
    <p class="home_act-3-agents_p">Each one leaves the system better described than it found it, so the value compounds with every cycle.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="home_act-3-agents_div-4">
    
      <div style="opacity:;transform:translateY(px);background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);border-radius:16px;padding:22px 20px;min-height:190px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px">
        <div style="width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:"></div>
        <div class="home_act-3-agents_div-5"></div>
        <div class="home_act-3-agents_div-6"></div>
      </div>
    
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Docs sync -->
<section data-screen-label="Docs sync" class="home_docs-sync_section">
  <div class="home_docs-sync_div">
    <div style="background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(30,28,25,.08);overflow:hidden;opacity:1;transform:translateY(0px)">
      <div class="home_docs-sync_div-2"><span class="home_docs-sync_span">User Documentation · Importing DXF</span><span class="home_docs-sync_span-2">OUT OF SYNC · 3 CHANGES</span></div>
      <div class="home_docs-sync_div-3">
        <div class="home_docs-sync_div-4">  Supported formats: DWG, DXF (R12–2018)</div>
        <div style="background:#f4d9d1;color:#8a3a26;text-decoration:line-through;border-radius:4px;padding:0 6px;margin:0 -6px;opacity:1;transform:translateX(0px)">- Files are parsed by the legacy DXF parser</div>
